      ":question/problem": "Suppose that $s(t) = 2t^{3} - t$ represents the position of a race car along a straight track, measured in feet from the starting line at $t$ seconds. What is the average rate of change of $s(t)$ from $t = 1$ to $t = 3$?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
